  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information</strong> :&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</a> </span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">has released the Final Result for the</span> Sub Inspector SI (Telecom)<span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"> Post. This recruitment was released for 98 posts.&nbsp;The applications for</span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"> RPSC SI Telecom Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 28 November 2024 to 27 December 2024. The written examination was held on 09-11 April 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their RPSC Rajasthan Police SI Telecom Final Result 2026 from the link given below.</span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RPSC Rajasthan Police SI Telecom Final Result 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>20 November 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>28 November 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>27 December 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>27 December 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>09 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>02 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>06 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>11 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET Date : <strong>09 -11 April 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET Result : <strong>20 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Final Result : <strong>20 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, Other State : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>600/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC, BC :<strong> Rs.</strong> <b>400/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>400/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Charge : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>500/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC SI Telecom Notification 2024 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">As on 01 January 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>20 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>25 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RPSC Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC Rajasthan Police SI Telecom 2024 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 98 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Sub Inspector (Telecom<strong>) Non TSP Area</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">94</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Sub Inspector (Telecom) TSP Area</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Category Wise Vacancy Details</b></span></h3>\n<table styl