All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download RPSC Rajasthan Police SI Telecom Final Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their RPSC Rajasthan Police SI Telecom Final Result candidates are required to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their RPSC Rajasthan Police SI Telecom Final Result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates need to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration No. /Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>DOB/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to check their RPSC Rajasthan Police SI Telecom Final Result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also check their RPSC Rajasthan Police SI Telecom Final Result from official site of the RPSC.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC Rajasthan Police SI Telecom Online Form 2024 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Physical Efficiency Test (PET) and Physical Standards Test (PST)</span></l